{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-38396-r4518983","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Neapolitan Anchovy Sauce","sourcePageId":38396,"sourceRevision":"4518983","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T17:19:46Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Neapolitan%20Anchovy%20Sauce&oldid=4518983","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:09:24.376Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Italian recipes","Category:Public domain recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments","Category:Recipes using anchovy","Category:Recipes using cream","Category:Recipes using fennel","Category:Recipes using fish","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using marjoram","Category:Recipes using vinegar","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"4ab868b71a43a478af524b85852927ff34fbb8975809beb522fd35af780c2a8a","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{recipesummary|category=Sauce recipes|time=10 minutes|difficulty=2\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n'''Neapolitan anchovy sauce''' is a delicious, creamy [[Cookbook:Sauces|sauce]], perfect for meat or vegetables.\n\n{{decameron}}\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Anchovy|anchovies]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:fennel|fennel]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]], chopped \n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Marjoram|marjoram]], chopped \n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1 clove [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], split\n* 1 dash of [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* 1 dash of [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Gill|gill]] [[Cookbook:Cream|cream]], [[Cookbook:Boiling|boiled]]\n* Bones of 1 [[Cookbook:Fish|fish]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Wash anchovies in vinegar; bone and pound with fennel and a cinnamon using a [[Cookbook:Mortar and Pestle|mortar and pestle]].\n# Mix in parsley and marjoram, a squeeze of lemon juice, flour, cream, and the bones of the fish for which you will use this sauce.\n# Pass through a [[Cookbook:Sieve|sieve]], add garlic, and [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]]. \n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n\n* If the fish you are using is cooked in the oven, add a little of the liquor in which it has been cooked to the sauce.\n* Take out the garlic before serving.\n* Instead of anchovies you may use caviar, pickled tunny, or any other pickled fish.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Italian recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using anchovy]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes using marjoram]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vinegar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fennel]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fish]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Neapolitan Anchovy Sauce","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"3 anchovies","sourceText":"3 anchovies","amountText":"3 anchovies","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 teaspoon fennel, chopped","sourceText":"1 teaspoon fennel, chopped","amountText":"1 teaspoon fennel, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 pinch cinnamon","sourceText":"1 pinch cinnamon","amountText":"1 pinch cinnamon","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 teaspoon parsley, chopped","sourceText":"1 teaspoon parsley, chopped","amountText":"1 teaspoon parsley, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 teaspoon marjoram, chopped","sourceText":"1 teaspoon marjoram, chopped","amountText":"1 teaspoon marjoram, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 teaspoon flour","sourceText":"1 teaspoon flour","amountText":"1 teaspoon flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 clove garlic, split","sourceText":"1 clove garlic, split","amountText":"1 clove garlic, split","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 dash of lemon juice","sourceText":"1 dash of lemon juice","amountText":"1 dash of lemon juice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"1 dash of vinegar","sourceText":"1 dash of vinegar","amountText":"1 dash of vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"½ gill cream, boiled","sourceText":"½ gill cream, boiled","amountText":"½ gill cream, boiled","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","name":"Bones of 1 fish","sourceText":"Bones of 1 fish","amountText":"Bones of 1 fish","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Wash anchovies in vinegar; bone and pound with fennel and a cinnamon using a mortar and pestle.","sourceText":"Wash anchovies in vinegar; bone and pound with fennel and a cinnamon using a mortar and pestle.","dura